    "title": "随着 + changing situation",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk4-prepositions-p04-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "随着 + changing situation",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "随着 links a main change to a developing circumstance. It expresses change in parallel, not just one completed cause.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "随着天气变冷，人越来越少。",
                "pinyin": "suízhe tiānqì biàn lěng ， rén yuèláiyuè shǎo 。",
                "meaning": "As the weather gets colder, there are fewer and fewer people.",
                "audio": "2d90d5493ee4886e1bd8c920ad91446d5599b192f6cebdf19f140f0fa7bea3c1"
              },
              {
                "text": "随着时间的变化，想法也变了。",
                "pinyin": "suízhe shíjiān de biànhuà ， xiǎngfǎ yě biàn le 。",
                "meaning": "As time changes, ideas change too.",
                "audio": "f09f1279917870a5b249d65b19a5240ed89ec44793e47e6a27afc4d767c71762"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "随着",
                "pinyin": "suízhe",
                "meaning": "along with; in the wake of",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "4adfae90056cc08eb15e009b17ff4b29c92d7afa2780573bca5d4dbd5e2040a4"
              }
            ]
          }
